cyrb53 hash by bryc (https://github.com/bryc/code), public domain.

jev-ultrafast
https://github.com/browser-use/jev-ultrafast

The decision loop is ported from jev-ultrafast, and the decision and text-helper prompts in
src/Decision/Prompts.php are copied from it, with added sentences on value formats and on
unavailable elements. Ported code:

- src/Agent: Agent, AgentOptions, Evidence, Faults, FieldValues, Fixation, HeldDecisions,
  PageQuestions, RunState, SettleTimings, Settler, Step
- src/Decision: ActionSpace, Choices, Decider, ModelClient, ModelConfig, PlanQuestions, Prompts,
  Questions, ReadOnlyActions, Scrolling, TextHelper
- src/Replay: Report, Replayer, Script

